  "2026-10-27T03:41:54.007Z",codex-agent,"Branch-gap acceptance: the broad real-SDK source selection passed 104/104; the added stale per-key resolution without ado_rev, unassigned terminal-close interruption, and existing assigned-close recovery pass 3/3. Empty assignment projection is shared by normal import and recovery (SDK explicit unset), eliminating duplicated handling. Build, test typecheck, documented declarations and whitespace checks pass. Checkpoint CI passed 663/663 on all four jobs but was correctly rejected for branch coverage; new full gates remain required at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-27T03:59:46.627Z",codex-agent,"CI checkpoint 34b7a8a passes 665/665 behavioral tests but still refuses 99.90% aggregate branches (two sync paths; resolution is now 100%). Added real-SDK acceptance for create recovery removing a server-default relation under explicit export, and an inverse endpoint with a durable local relation that remains unagreed on Azure: retry returns typed conflict without PATCH or tracker changes, then converges when the inverse becomes visible. Both pass 2/2; raw runtime counters confirm the previously missed paths. No production behavior change in this follow-up. Final differential on 34b7a8a passes 14/14 over 140 public items. Pinned PM linked runs pass 5/5 fixed cases and 6/6 agreement cases; strict health passes with only the pre-existing telemetry queue advisory."
