  "2026-10-27T05:50:19.683Z",codex-agent,"Auto-round-1 class audit: graph writes originate in importRelations (normal application and compensation) and all command paths pass the same guarded SDK update callback. Extracted planRelationImport so dry-run and execution preflight share the complete endpoint footprint, including unselected endpoints and prospective remote sources. The guard checks durable foreign history and each existing endpoint against its own agreed graph base; SDK matches still protect edits after planning. Explicit import/export keep their documented direction choice. ResolutionFields was the only valid partial-base path hashing a missing key; unknown coordinates now remain null through plan hashing, validation, saved Plan/JSON artifact apply and replay. All other digest call sites require complete outcomes or catch malformed private intents as typed refusals; refresh, contract and move commands are read-only. Added two-direction clear/retarget/dependency adversarial cases, fully agreed endpoints without pending intents, prospective sources, and 512 partial-base masks. Initial supplied-case regressions failed on 8291569 as expected (three unselected-endpoint variants plus partial-plan and mask tests); existing tests are retained. Expanded packed npm/Bun launcher acceptance for both classes. No additional non-blocking findings are listed in the supplied resume or GitHub inline reviews; the full review artifact has been requested while these fixes proceed."
