  "2026-10-27T06:52:48.151Z",codex-agent,"Current before/after proof passes 14/14 comparisons on two read-only public tracker corpora (32 and 108 items; 140 total). Import/export/sync dry-runs, resolution plan, writable-copy import output, values and net history patches remain identical after documented diagnostic normalization. Intent markers, path ordering, three guarded events and internal per-key revision coordinates are intentional. R4 recovery refusal and missing-base handling are deliberate fixes to unsafe/throwing cases, separately covered by adversarial regressions. Main re-fetched and still fully incorporated (zero behind). Typecheck, test typecheck, docstrings (111 declarations) and whitespace pass; no standalone lint exists. Linked PM round-4 regression command passes all 24 tests with zero failures. Starting sequential npm and Bun release gates at unchanged 100% thresholds and at most two workers."
  "2026-10-27T07:26:28.744Z",codex-agent,"Full local npm release gate reached the packed acceptance parent timeout (900 seconds): all six original launcher shapes and two new global-runtime cases passed; remaining children were canceled. The known-failed run was stopped without claiming full counts or coverage, and the required Bun release gate is now running separately. No assertions, timeouts or thresholds were weakened. All 24 new focused regressions, 14 public differential comparisons, function-only revert proofs, typechecks and docstrings remain passed. Current full npm and Bun CI release gates will be authoritative complete-suite evidence. The prior source checkpoint also passed all 12 packed parent/child cases before the latest additional project endpoint checks."
  "2026-10-27T07:38:42.094Z",codex-agent,"Pushed source f7f89e95628e221e63b00093a10cf740cd77a7b7. Exact-head CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/40467343302 is running all four jobs, including complete npm and Bun release gates; CodeQL https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/40467343299 passed. The local Bun release attempt also failed in packed installer setup before any launcher case began (391809 ms); its known-failed remaining suite was stopped. Detailed installer failure was not emitted before suite end, so no unverified network cause or full local pass is claimed. Local npm reached its 900-second packed parent timeout after eight passing launcher cases. All assertions and thresholds remain intact. Full CI, not these incomplete local attempts, will supply final package counts. PR title/body updated and verified using the REST API after the older gh pr edit GraphQL path was rejected by the Projects-classic deprecation. No merge, release or thread replies."
  "2026-10-27T08:04:01.156Z",codex-agent,"Source f7f89e95628e221e63b00093a10cf740cd77a7b7 is verified by https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/40467343302 : 4/4 successful jobs (Node 22, Node 26, complete npm release gate and complete Bun release gate). Each passes 696/696 tests in V8 and independent statement runs, zero failures or skips. All 11 required sources have 100% statements, lines, branches and functions; 1997/1997 statements. CodeQL https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/40467343299 passed. Current 512-sequence model seed 0x37a9c521: 278 interruptions, 408 converged retries, 104 typed conflicts. The 500-sequence normalization model, 500 exact/50 older replays, 36 create/33 PATCH outcome models and 344 edit/SIGKILL cells also pass. Focused PM-linked round-4 command passes 24/24; all 14 differential comparisons across 140 public items pass. Function-only reverts recorded above fail for endpoint guards (9/12), missing-base projection (2/2), native alias normalization (3/3 each), and terminal preview/storage remedy (1/1 each); restored cases pass. Both audited SDK findings and both supplied auto-round-1 blockers are fixed, none deferred. Exactly 7 original implementation lines and 90 core lines in the total diff were removed. No additional non-blocking findings appear in the supplied report or public reviews. SDK preview-runtime, close-match and host-facade gaps remain explicit. Local full attempts were incomplete (npm packed parent timeout; Bun installer setup failure); neither is claimed green."
